command:scribe

** Generate a database schema report bundle
For more information, see https://www.schemacrawler.com/scribe.html

language
BCP 47 language tag for localized report text, for example, fr or de-DE; the default is the system locale

include-lint
Whether to include lint results in the report

expanded-output
Whether to write the report as expanded files and folders instead of a single ZIP archive

Add command options to the `execute` command in the SchemaCrawler Shell
